## 2026-10-28T02:23:07Z JACQUES
{"slug":"JACQUES","companyName":"Jacques Technologies","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/jacques","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T02:23:07Z","followerCount":14005,"bio":"Jacques designs and manufactures communication-critical intercom & public address products that seamlessly integrates with VMS, SMS & access control systems resulting in a complete security solution. Built initially & especially for the corrections market and with over 40 years\u2019 we\u2019re the experts in critical security communication.\n\nMore than an intercom system. Built for prisons, built to last. A Jacques IP Communication solution is built tough for critical, security communication for the corrections market, yet flexible & scalable for longevity of investment.\n\nWe are a solutions provider. We deploy communication solutions that are responsive to customer requirements and market demands. They are adaptive across many markets - hospitals, commercial buildings, education facilities including schools, industrial, smart/safe cities and transport networks.","recentPosts":[{"date":"2026-06-09","text":"5 days to go!\nWe're excited to see our ASBA members at the ASBA VIC chapter in Melbourne this weekend.\nIf you're attending, come visit us at stand 29\nSTAND 29\nPullman on the Park","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/jacques/home/"},{"date":"2026-05-07","text":"4 weeks to go! We're coming to Perth\nWe\u2019re excited to be exhibiting at this year\u2019s IPSHA Conference and looking forward to connecting with leaders across the education sector.\n4th - 6th June, Freemantle\n#IPSHA2026 #SchoolSafety #PublicAddress #SmartSchools","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/jacques/home/"},{"date":"2026-02-13","text":"Clear communication. Smarter security. Total reliability.\nOur latest Video Intercom System Brochure showcases how Jacques Technologies delivers high-performance audio and video communication solutions for mission-critical environments.\nDesigned for commercial buildings, healthcare,